    "explicit_requirements": [
      "Build a complete budget-vs-actual variance analysis workbook for Pfizer covering the income statement, balance sheet, and key per-share metrics using the pinned EDGAR XBRL facts for Q1 2026 (2026-03-29).",
      "Include a comparison of Q1 2026 actual Revenues ($14.451B) against Q1 2025 figures and consensus estimates, with dollar and percentage variances clearly labeled.",
