      "Break out Selling, General & Administrative expense ($2.961B) and Cost of Goods and Services Sold ($3.548B) as separate line items with variance drivers noted.",
      "Present a balance sheet summary with Assets ($207.618B), Liabilities ($117.214B), Stockholders' Equity ($90.101B), and Cash and Cash Equivalents ($1.703B) versus prior quarter or year-end figures.",
      "Report diluted EPS of $0.47 with variance analysis against prior period and consensus.",
      "Use 2023 annual RevenueFromContractWithCustomerExcludingAssessedTax ($50.914B) as the full-year baseline reference where annual context is needed.",
